{"id":"n6df63b2a17","headline":"Government Extends Ban on Hoarding of Urea and Syringes for Two Months - Economy | Hankook Ilbo","summary":"The government is extending its hoarding ban on urea and syringes by two months amid Middle East supply chain instability. It is also easing storage limits on urea, diesel exhaust fluid, syringes and needles.","why":"Urea is a key nitrogen fertilizer and diesel exhaust fluid input, so supply disruptions affect agriculture and vehicle emissions compliance costs.","category":"economy","event_type":"regulation","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Seoul","country":"South Korea","lat":37.566,"lon":126.978,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"한국일보","url":"https://www.hankookilbo.com/news/article/A2026081916560004731"},"sources":[{"name":"한국일보","url":"https://www.hankookilbo.com/news/article/A2026081916560004731"}],"published_at":"2026-08-19T22:40:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-14T16:29:26Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"500a71d7ed787652","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-14T16:29:26Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-19T22:40:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-08-20T00:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"KS","description_from":"publisher page metadata, translated to English by Claude"},"headline_translated":true,"original_headline":"정부 \"요소·주사기 매점매석 금지 조치 2개월 연장\"-경제ㅣ한국일보","source_language":"kor","image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/shopping-retail-store-3530785.jpg","alt":"shopping retail store (illustration)","credit":"Mohamed_hassan","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/ecommerce-shopping-cart-buying-3530785/"}}